          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'muwi'le Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya ati', ‘I'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. Yi'li'koov'iwa cheni'cho ki'si'nzi'lwe ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu aho ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ki'li'si'nzi'lagwa. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'sondo muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhozya u'yo alaki'egezye ki'taambo cheni'cho hu' mwene alaki'lye. Alaki'lyi'le ha hantu' hasondo, ha lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho ki'lakuumye nyama ya kalu'mbi'lo yi'li'koov'iwa ki'v'e ki'sondo, na u'lu' genago magazi ganyantu'ki'le ku' ki'zwalo ninga ki'mo, Yi'li'koov'iwa ku'ki'kanzi'la ha hantu' hasondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nnungu' i'yo yi'latekele nyama yeni'yo yi'li'koov'iwa yi'v'elwe, ali'vi u'lu' yatekelagwa mu ki'seme cha shaba, ki'seme cheni'cho ki'lakwemwe na ku'ngu'lu'ziwa na minzi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la mugosya mugati' na mugana gwa muhozya hu' u'yo akowolile ku'lya nyama yeni'yo. Yi'li' nsondo muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi magazi ga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi u'lu' galetagwa mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ki'gele ku'v'ezezya wu'swanano ha hantu' hasondo, ki'taambo cheni'cho ki'kasye ki'liwe. Sumbwa ki'lazigiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
